From e6b35cc11f2ccaf8741babad2e985a1426a10cb6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 20:36:55 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] config: NordVPN and Surfshark off (no Reaper page or code
 uses them) (102.8 line)

Owner, 2026-11-05: remove the unused third-party VPN hooks. RTCONFIG_NORDVPN
and RTCONFIG_SURFSHARK only added the nordvpn / surfshark rc commands and
their /sbin links, the rc_support tokens, the nordvpn_token and surfshark_*
nvram defaults (password and token among them) and their VPN client branches.
No Reaper page offers either provider and nothing in Reaper calls them; the
closed tpvpn.o that carries their code stays linked, untouched.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 release/src/router/config_base | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/release/src/router/config_base b/release/src/router/config_base
index acb42d5c826..8289efff851 100644
--- a/release/src/router/config_base
+++ b/release/src/router/config_base
@@ -778,8 +778,8 @@ RTCONFIG_FSMD=y
 # RTCONFIG_AUTO_WANPORT is not set
 # RTCONFIG_FU_TEST is not set
 # RTCONFIG_HMA is not set
-RTCONFIG_NORDVPN=y
-RTCONFIG_SURFSHARK=y
+# RTCONFIG_NORDVPN is not set
+# RTCONFIG_SURFSHARK is not set
 # RTCONFIG_PASS_V2 is not set
 # RTCONFIG_NVSW_IN_JFFS is not set
 # RTCONFIG_DISWIFI7 is not set
-- 
2.25.1

